_2019-06-15_22-54-20-416.png/revision/latest?cb=20190701133748"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:EXPOTamaNewsBoard.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/d/d7/EXPOTamaNewsBoard.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20230417044628","caption":"На доске новостей Тама (Tama & Earth Expo)","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/d/d7/EXPOTamaNewsBoard.png/revision/latest?cb=20230417044628"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:ExpoHotDogEatingContest.PNG","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/9/97/ExpoHotDogEatingContest.PNG/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20230417043911","caption":"Интервьюирование участников","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/9/97/ExpoHotDogEatingContest.PNG/revision/latest?cb=20230417043911"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Gg913200.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/1b/Gg913200.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20230924194149","caption":"Reportchi.","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/1b/Gg913200.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230924194149"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Gg913257.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/5/58/Gg913257.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20230924194356","caption":"Reportchi Весна.","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/5/58/Gg913257.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230924194356"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:G9t98.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/4/4d/G9t98.png/revision/latest?cb=20181019195336","caption":"Reportchi Алиса."},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Gg918883.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/fb/Gg918883.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20230923004327","caption":"Reportchi Аладдин.","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/fb/Gg918883.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230923004327"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Gg913434.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/0b/Gg913434.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20230924194332","caption":"Gg913434.jpg","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/0b/Gg913434.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230924194332"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Gg918698.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/2/2e/Gg918698.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20230924194513","caption":"Gg918698.jpg","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/2/2e/Gg918698.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230924194513"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Gg918777.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/6/6b/Gg918777.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20230924194614","caption":"Gg918777.jpg","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/6/6b/Gg918777.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230924194614"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Tamagotchi-nnc-dsjapan_reportchi-stand.gif","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/02/Tamagotchi-nnc-dsjapan_reportchi-stand.gif/revision/latest?cb=20181029040111","caption":"Reportchi Tamagotchi нет спрайта Канала Нарикири","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:M37955307626_1_(1).jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/a/a2/M37955307626_1_%281%29.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20181014223329","caption":"Плюш Reportchi","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/a/a2/M37955307626_1_%281%29.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20181014223329"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Tamagotchden04.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/6/64/Tamagotchden04.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20